---
description: Tech stack and conventions for LeadFlow
alwaysApply: true
---

- React 19 + Vite + TypeScript strict. Never use `any`.
- Tailwind v3 only, using design tokens from tailwind.config.ts. No inline styles, no other CSS libs.
- Data access only through TanStack Query hooks in features/\*/hooks. Components never import mock data.
- Forms use React Hook Form + Zod; infer types from schemas.
- Use the `@/` path alias. Max ~250 lines per file; split components early.
- Reuse components from components/ui before creating new ones.
- Statuses, sources, and stages are DATA, never hardcoded enums.
- Every data view needs loading, empty, and error states.
- Currency is formatted via the shared INR formatter in lib/.
